/**
 * The curated example library (examples/embedded/*.ohmlet.json, generated by
 * scripts/build-examples.mjs from examples/embedded/src/*.example.mjs).
 *
 * For every example:
 *   - the generated files are in sync with the descriptors and the firmware
 *     (`node scripts/build-examples.mjs --check`);
 *   - the file parses as an 'ohmlet-project' envelope (parseProject: layout
 *     validated by validateLayout, firmware size + SHA-256 verified) and its
 *     embedded ELF is byte-identical to the current firmware/dist ELF — a
 *     firmware rebuild without re-running the example build fails here;
 *   - the ERC reports no 'error' finding, and every 'risk' is one the
 *     descriptor declares (and explains in its text);
 *   - the logic-analyzer channels and decoders point at real pins / channels;
 *   - it runs 0.5–2 s on the SimulationCoordinator — the REAL firmware on the
 *     REAL circuit — with no runtime 'error' issue, prints the expected UART
 *     text (the firmware 'checks' boot text unless the example's own circuit
 *     changes it) and shows its key behavior (LED edges, display contents,
 *     motor motion, sensor readings, interactive button / encoder / remote).
 */
